\par\par \b \uc2  Japan MOF Watanabe: To Act If  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Moves Too Fast \b0\par\par\uc2 233 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Januar 2003\par 10:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO -(Dow Jones)- The Japanese authorities will act against irregular or rapid movements in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates, a top Finance Ministry official said Wednesday, warning markets that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  is ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem yen strength. \par \par \uc2  "If there are irregular movements, or if movements are too fast, we will take steps," said Hiroshi Watanabe, the new head of the International Bureau at the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Watanabe, who took over the post last week when Zembei Mizoguchi was promoted to vice finance minister for international affairs, was speaking to reporters in an evening briefing. Watanabe says he plans to meet the press one evening a week, usually Thursday, as his schedule allows. \par \par \uc2  Watanabe said the dollar used to be a safe-haven \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in which investors would park their money in times of international tensions. \par \par \uc2  "Now, whenever a bomb goes off someplace, the dollar falls," he said. "Geopolitical risk is now a factor to sell the dollar." \par \par \uc2  He maintained the ministry's mantra that authorities are always keeping a close eye on the market and that \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates ought to reflect fundamentals. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't be a "big topic" when Group of Seven finance minister gather in Paris next month, he said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    -By Arran Scott and Miyako Takebe; 813-5255-2928;\par arran.scott@dowjones.com; miyako.takebe@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030122dz1m000m6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
