\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  MOF Mizoguchi: Ready To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  As Needed \b0\par\par\uc2 218 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Januar 2003\par 01:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's top \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  official fired another warning shot into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Friday, saying the authorities are always primed to stem excessive \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves. \par \par \uc2  "We are always prepared to take appropriate steps whenever needed," Zembei Mizoguchi, vice minister for international affairs, told reporters. \par \par \uc2  Late Thursday, the dollar fell into the mid-Y117s on fears that a war in the Middle East is now more likely after the discovery of empty chemical warheads in Iraq by United Nations weapons inspectors. \par \par \uc2  At 0033 GMT, the dollar was trading at Y117.87, up a fraction from Y117.83 late Thursday in New York. \par \par \uc2  Underscoring that the authorities remain on high alert against yen strength, Mizoguchi said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  is closely monitoring the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  Mizoguchi also reiterated that economic conditions don't favor yen appreciation in the medium term and that current yen strength is unlikely to last long. \par \par \uc2  Tokyo is concerned about the damage a strong yen does to Japanese companies' overseas earnings when repatriated, and the deflationary pressure it puts on the nation's struggling economy. \par \par \uc2  Mizoguchi took over Tuesday from Haruhiko Kuroda, who is retiring. \par \par \uc2  -By Ron Harui, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2942; ron.harui@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030117dz1h0000r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
