\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  Shiokawa: Want BOJ Unsterilized  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 249 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 November 2002\par 01:55\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO -(Dow Jones)- Japanese Finance Minister Masajuro Shiokawa reiterated Tuesday he wants the Bank of Japan to ease policy further and urged the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  not to mop up extra yen left in the market from possible \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Please don't sterilize them," Shiokawa said, apparently referring to yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market by the BOJ. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ policy board is due to end a meeting later Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The minister said he would want such unsterilized BOJ actions to continue until deflation was defeated. \par \par \uc2  Asked about the government's tax plans, Shiokawa said he wanted tax breaks to be revenue-neutral over a period of five years. The Government Tax Commission will submit to Prime Minister Junichiro Koizumi later Tuesday its proposals, which echo those of the MOF closely, for tax reforms for the fiscal year starting April 1. \par \par \uc2  On Friday, the government will start hammering out a supplementary spending package for this fiscal year, and Shiokawa said he will try to ensure the package reflects as clearly as possible the requests of the coalition. The government and the Liberal Democratic Party-led coalition will meet this week to work on the package. \par \par \uc2  However, he also indicated he wouldn't swallow whole the coalition's requests regarding the size of the package. The coalition has been calling for Y5 trillion to Y10 trillion in stimulus spending. \par \par \uc2  -By James Simms, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; james.simms@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020021119dybj00024\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
